## Commands (this app; from the series root)
- Build + lint: `JAVA_HOME="$HOME/AppData/Local/Android/jdk-21" ./gradlew :__APP__:assembleDebug :__APP__:lintDebug`
- Run: `adb -s <dev> shell am start -n io.github.whatwhatwhoa.__APP__/.MainActivity`
- Release asset name: `__ASSET__-<version>.apk`
